1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,905
W: Did you see Nate Houseman's newest book was reviewed in the Peterson Daily today?

2
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:05,560
M: Really?

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,640
How did the reviewer like it?

4
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:11,330
W: He enjoyed the story, but he pointed out a few problems with the book.

5
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,500
Here, take a look at his ratings.

6
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,380
M: Hmm...Check out this two-star rating.

7
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:19,620
You know, Nate's already working on the third book in the series.

8
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,815
He said he'd submit it for review in two months.

9
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,640
W: We'd better have a meeting to discuss this issue.

10
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:29,280
If he can make it better, the entire series will be improved.

11
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:30,740
M: I agree.

12
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:33,735
I'll contact him and find out when he can fly up here.
